<title>NEW ZEALAND: Brash to appear before NZ F&amp;E committee, 11.00 am.</title>
<headline>Brash to appear before NZ F&amp;E committee, 11.00 am.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reserve Bank Governor Don Brash is due to appear before Parliament's Finance and Expenditure Committee starting at 11.00 a.m. (2300 GMT) on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The committee is reviewing the RBNZ's annual report.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
